== ui_card "Button Helper"
  p The <code>ui_button</code> helper renders a standardized, accessible button element.
  
  h4 Usage
  pre style="background: #f4f4f4; padding: 1rem; border-radius: 4px;"
    code == ui_button "Label", :variance, options
    
  h4 Variants
  p The <code>:variance</code> argument controls the visual style.
  
  .sp-cluster
    == ui_button ":primary", :primary
    == ui_button ":neutral", :neutral
    == ui_button ":danger", :danger
    
  h4 With Icons
  p You can pass HTML/SVG content as the label.
  
  == ui_button :neutral, class: "sp-btn--icon" do
    span ☰ Menu

  h4 Playground
  p Try it out in the <a href="/docs/playground">Playground</a>.
